WEBVTT

00:08:29.741 --> 00:08:30.981
It didn't work.

00:08:31.362 --> 00:08:33.705
It's a lot of hard work,
not being yourself.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:37.340
I have a few questions for you all.

00:08:38.612 --> 00:08:39.762
Who are you?

00:08:41.074 --> 00:08:42.878
How many versions of you are there?

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:46.272
And I have one final question:

00:08:47.031 --> 00:08:50.040
Are you using them all to your advantage?

00:08:51.503 --> 00:08:55.163
In reality, everyone is capable
of creating their own masterpiece.

00:08:55.847 --> 00:08:57.628
You should try it sometime.

00:08:57.652 --> 00:08:58.802
It's quite fun.

00:08:59.453 --> 00:09:00.604
Thank you.